><surname>Boudreau</surname><given-names>N.</given-names></name><name><surname>Bissell</surname><given-names>M.J.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Extracellular matrix signalingintegration of form and function in normal and malignant cells</article-title><source>Curr. Opin. Cell Biol.</source><volume>10</volume><year>1998</year><fpage>640</fpage><lpage>646</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9818175</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Brooksetal1996"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brooks</surname><given-names>P.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Stromblad</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Sanders</surname><given-names>L.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>von Schalscha</surname><given-names>T.L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Aimes</surname><given-names>R.T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Stetler-Stevenson</surname><given-names>W.G.</given-names></name><name><surname>Quigley</surname><given-names>J.P.</given-names></name><name><surname>Cheresh</surname><given-names>D.A.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Localization of matrix metalloproteinase MMP-2 to the surface of invasive cells by interaction with integrin &#x003b1;v&#x003b2;3</article-title><source>Cell.</source><volume>85</volume><year>1996</year><fpage>683</fpage><lpage>693</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8646777</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Carpenetal1992"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Carpen</surname><given-names>O.</given-names></name><name><surname>Pallai</surname><given-names>P.</given-names></name><name><surname>Staunton</surname><given-names>D.E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Springer</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Association of intercellular-adhesion molecule-1 (ICAM-1) with actin-containing cytoskeleton and &#x003b1;-actinin</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.